%N A200977 Smallest number expressible in the form a^2 + 2*b^2, with positive integers a and b, in exactly n ways.
%C A200977 a(n) is the smallest nonnegative k such that A216278(k) = n. - _Seiichi Manyama_, Aug 22 2026
%H A200977 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A200977/b200977.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..100</a>
%F A200977 All terms are multiples of 3.
%e A200977 3 = 1+2*1^2.
%e A200977 27 = 3+2*3^2 = 5^2+2*1^2.
%e A200977 99 = 1+2*7^2 = 7^2+2*5^2 = 9^2+2*3^2.
%Y A200977 Cf. A328151, A374158, A399191, A374159, A374160, A374161.
%Y A200977 Cf. A154777 (numbers of the form a^2 + 2*b^2 with positive integers a, b), A216278, A374285.
